## Setup

Needs Xcode (the full app, not only the Command Line Tools).

{% if include_mise -%}
```bash
mise install                  # XcodeGen + the lint tools, pinned
mise run setup:dev            # install the git hooks
mise run check                # the lints + {{ gate_script }}, as CI runs them
```
{% else -%}
```bash
uv tool install pre-commit    # if not already installed
pre-commit install            # enable git hooks
./{{ gate_script }}  # the merge check
```
{% endif %}
`{{ gate_script }}` is the project's merge check: add the app's build and test steps there.

